                    300.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "She may, in addition, be required to do all other work in the meat department not normally performed by a Journeyman Meat Cutter or Apprentice, including cleaning of cases, work tables, or any other housecleaning chores required in the meat department.",
